---
import yoCallendo from "../assets/Yo_callendo.png";
import htmlIcon from "../assets/HTMl.webp";
import javaIcon from "../assets/Java.png";
import jsIcon from "../assets/JavaScript.png";
import cssIcon from "../assets/CSS.webp";
import cppIcon from "../assets/C++.png";
import pythonIcon from "../assets/Python-logo-notext.svg.png";
import postgresIcon from "../assets/Postgresql_elephant.svg";
import nodeIcon from "../assets/nodejs-200.png";
import mysqlIcon from "../assets/My SQL.png";
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="w-[min(95%,160rem)] mx-auto mt-16 px-4 md:px-8 py-16 relative min-h-[40vh] z-10"
>
  <!-- Tarjeta About Me -->
  <div class="bg-transparent mb-20">
    <div class="text-center mb-20 relative w-full">
      <h2
        class="text-[4rem] text-white font-bold inline-block relative pb-6 m-0 capitalize drop-shadow-[0_3px_6px_rgba(0,29,61,0.5)] after:content-[''] after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[80px] after:h-[5px] after:bg-gradient-to-r after:from-[#00ffff] after:via-[#0077b6] after:to-[#00ffff] after:bg-[length:200%_auto] after:rounded-full after:shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(0,255,255,0.5)] after:animate-[flowLine_3s_linear_infinite]"
        data-key="about.title"
      >
        About
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="flex justify-center lg:flex-[1.2] w-full max-w-[80rem]">
        <img
          src={yoCallendo.src}
          alt="Eric Cayendo"
          class="w-full lg:min-w-[60rem] lg:scale-110 h-auto object-contain drop-shadow-[0_15px_25px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-125 hover:-translate-y-4 animate-[float_6s_ease-in-out_infinite]"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-[100rem] lg:flex-1">
        <p
          class="text-[1.8rem] text-gray-300 mb-8 text-justify font-body leading-relaxed z-10 relative drop-shadow-md"
          data-key="about.p1"
        >
          ¡Hola! Soy Eric Perucho. Mi camino en el código empezó con una meta
          clara: entender cómo funcionan las cosas desde adentro. Soy
          Desarrollador Full Stack con base en análisis de sistemas, pero más
          que eso, soy un apasionado por resolver problemas y nunca dejar de
          aprender.
        </p>
        <p
          class="text-[1.8rem] text-gray-300 mb-8 text-justify font-body leading-relaxed z-10 relative drop-shadow-md"
          data-key="about.p2"
        >
          Hace poco decidí llevar mi aprendizaje al siguiente nivel creando
          Perucho Dev, un espacio donde comparto mi proceso dominando la lógica
          de programación y lenguajes como Java y Python. No solo busco
          construir software robusto; mi objetivo es diseñar soluciones que
          realmente le hagan la vida más fácil al usuario.
        </p>
        <p
          class="text-[1.8rem] text-gray-300 mb-8 text-justify font-body leading-relaxed z-10 relative drop-shadow-md"
          data-key="about.p3"
        >
          Actualmente estoy en proceso de titulación y siempre busco entornos
          donde la precisión y el trabajo en equipo sean la clave. Si algo me
          define, es mi curiosidad insaciable: si no lo sé, lo investigo; si lo
          aprendo, te lo explico.
        </p>

        <blockquote
          class="mt-12 border-l-4 border-[#00ffff] pl-8 italic bg-white/5 p-4 rounded-r-lg"
        >
          <p
            class="font-serif text-[2rem] text-white mb-4 drop-shadow-md"
            data-key="about.quote"
          >
            "El mar, una vez que lanza su hechizo, atrapa a uno en su red de
            maravillas para siempre."
          </p>
          <footer
            class="text-right font-bold text-gray-400 text-[1.6rem]"
            data-key="about.author"
          >
            - Jacques Yves Cousteau
          </footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Sección Skills (Logo Loop) -->
  <div class="bg-transparent mb-20 w-full overflow-hidden relative">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 relative w-full flex flex-col items-center">
      <h2
        class="text-[4rem] text-white font-bold inline-block relative pb-6 m-0 capitalize drop-shadow-[0_3px_6px_rgba(0,29,61,0.5)] after:content-[''] after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[80px] after:h-[5px] after:bg-gradient-to-r after:from-marine-deep after:via-marine-teal after:to-marine-deep after:bg-[length:200%_auto] after:rounded-full after:shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(0,206,209,0.5)] after:animate-[flowLine_3s_linear_infinite]"
        data-key="skills.title"
      >
        Skills
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative flex w-full overflow-hidden group mask-image-fade py-8"
    >
      <!-- First Marquee Track -->
      <div
        class="flex animate-marquee whitespace-nowrap group-hover:[animation-play-state:paused]"
      >
        {
          [
            {
              name: "Astro",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/astro/astro-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Java",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/java/java-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Python",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/python/python-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "MySQL",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/mysql/mysql-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Git",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/git/git-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "GitHub",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/github/github-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Node.js",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/nodejs/nodejs-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "JavaScript",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/javascript/javascript-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "HTML",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/html5/html5-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "CSS",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/css3/css3-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "TypeScript",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/typescript/typescript-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Tailwind",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/tailwindcss/tailwindcss-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "PostgreSQL",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/postgresql/postgresql-original.svg",
            },
          ].map((skill) => (
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center mx-8 sm:mx-12 min-w-[120px] transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-110">
              <div class="w-[70px] h-[70px] mb-4 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-3 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <img
                  src={skill.img}
                  alt={skill.name}
                  class="w-full h-full object-contain drop-shadow-md"
                  loading="lazy"
                  onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/devicon/devicon-original.svg';"
                />
              </div>
              <span class="text-white font-bold text-[1.4rem] tracking-wide drop-shadow-md">
                {skill.name}
              </span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <!-- Second Marquee Track (Duplicate for seamless loop) -->
      <div
        class="flex animate-marquee2 whitespace-nowrap absolute top-8 group-hover:[animation-play-state:paused]"
      >
        {
          [
            {
              name: "Astro",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/astro/astro-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Java",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/java/java-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Python",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/python/python-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "MySQL",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/mysql/mysql-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Git",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/git/git-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "GitHub",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/github/github-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Node.js",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/nodejs/nodejs-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "JavaScript",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/javascript/javascript-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "HTML",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/html5/html5-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "CSS",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/css3/css3-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "TypeScript",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/typescript/typescript-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "Tailwind",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/tailwindcss/tailwindcss-original.svg",
            },
            {
              name: "PostgreSQL",
              img: "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/postgresql/postgresql-original.svg",
            },
          ].map((skill) => (
            <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center mx-8 sm:mx-12 min-w-[120px] transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-110">
              <div class="w-[70px] h-[70px] mb-4 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm p-3 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <img
                  src={skill.img}
                  alt={skill.name}
                  class="w-full h-full object-contain drop-shadow-md"
                  loading="lazy"
                  onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/devicon/devicon-original.svg';"
                />
              </div>
              <span class="text-white font-bold text-[1.4rem] tracking-wide drop-shadow-md">
                {skill.name}
              </span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mask-image-fade {
    mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent,
      black 10%,
      black 90%,
      transparent
    );
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent,
      black 10%,
      black 90%,
      transparent
    );
  }
  .animate-marquee {
    animation: marquee 35s linear infinite;
  }
  .animate-marquee2 {
    animation: marquee2 35s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes marquee {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(0%);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateX(-100%);
    }
  }
  @keyframes marquee2 {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(100%);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateX(0%);
    }
  }
</style>
